# The printed business cards carry a QR code that still encodes the old
# Netlify address, while the text on them reads ameliabobbin.com. This sends
# anyone who scans it on to the real domain.
#
# The trailing ! forces the rule: without it the real page at that path wins
# and the redirect never fires. :splat carries the rest of the path across, so
# a deep link still lands in the right place.
#
# NOTE: do not rename or delete the Netlify site. The printed QR codes are
# permanently tied to the name "ameliab-portfolio".

https://ameliab-portfolio.netlify.app/*   https://ameliabobbin.com/:splat   301!
http://ameliab-portfolio.netlify.app/*    https://ameliabobbin.com/:splat   301!
